@startuml
title 5G 5G-AKA Authentication

participant UE
participant gNB
participant AMF
participant AUSF
participant UDM

UE -> gNB: Registration Request (SUCI)
gNB -> AMF: Initial UE Message

AMF -> AUSF: Auth Request
AUSF -> UDM: Auth Data Request
UDM -> AUSF: Auth Data Response
AUSF -> AMF: Auth Response

AMF -> UE: Security Mode Command
UE -> AMF: Security Mode Complete

@enduml
